{"mode":"Blocks","hardwareTarget":"brain","workspace":"<xml xmlns=\"https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml\"><variables><variable id=\"U`9aA+=)r+L1tzA.)-qi\">myVariable</variable></variables><comment id=\")9)5QfSF/7+IUu=0@4D3\" x=\"628\" y=\"82\" h=\"272\" w=\"406\">Project: Carrying a Disk\n\nDescription: This example project starts with the Robot Arm down and place a disk on the Electromagnet. When the project begins, the Arm will move up while holding the disk.  Next, the base will spin. Then, the Arm will drop the disk.\n\nConfiguration: Robot Arm</comment><block type=\"go_events_when_started\" id=\".NsXwU_L.OuU1l7Sho$F\" deletable=\"false\" x=\"70\" y=\"110\"><next><block type=\"go_other_comment\" id=\"?JdAwf,W=k^Bl|-:4P%n\"><value name=\"COMMENT\"><shadow type=\"comment_text\" id=\"rj(|7_!r(T?tRju`vAf$\"><field name=\"comment\">Power on the Electromagnet</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"go_magnet_energize\" id=\"kl,Tp?[P!)P1L[fP9710\"><field name=\"MAGNET\">magnet</field><field name=\"ACTION\">boost</field><next><block type=\"go_other_comment\" id=\"v*NCr@GOSS/ea2)/Cr[`\"><value name=\"COMMENT\"><shadow type=\"comment_text\" id=\"b[Ja]V:U~u8M`JbW^s_H\"><field name=\"comment\">Spin the Arm up</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"go_motion_spin_for\" id=\"nFKmJW:pHQERmoQ%SHfy\"><field name=\"MOTOR\">arm</field><field name=\"DIRECTION\">fwd</field><field name=\"UNITS\">deg</field><field name=\"anddontwait_mutator\">false</field><value name=\"AMOUNT\"><shadow type=\"math_number\" id=\"1i+_[y5msb@^|63yZ^(=\"><field name=\"NUM\">45</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"go_control_wait\" id=\"q9wVPgqJYY|8Peu=VMmG\"><value name=\"DURATION\"><shadow type=\"math_positive_number\" id=\"G3hhzGD{qJQDp@:Rok}c\"><field name=\"NUM\">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type=\"go_other_comment\" id=\"BX?cy{N3+-kAbmee]sHF\"><value name=\"COMMENT\"><shadow type=\"comment_text\" id=\"~+azeTrU-e[sSI9^;kHa\"><field name=\"comment\">Spin the base with th